sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Router as FastAPI Router
    participant Manager as Manager Agent
    participant Plan as Plan Agent
    participant MCP as OXII MCP Server
    participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Pro

    Note over User,LLM: Case 3: Create Smart Home Plans<br/>"Have 1 person in the living room. Create plan."<br/>Total Time: ~29.71s

    %% === REQUEST PHASE ===
    User->>+Router: POST /ai/chat/text<br/>"Have 1 person in the living room.<br/>Create plan."
    Note over Router: 2025-11-02 03:38:29

    %% === MANAGER ROUTING ===
    Router->>+Manager: Process request
    
    rect rgb(200, 220, 240)
        Note over Manager,LLM: 🔍 ANALYZE & ROUTE
        Manager->>+LLM: Analyze query
        Note over LLM: Intent: create automation plan<br/>⏱️ ~6s
        LLM-->>-Manager: {<br/>  agent_type: "plan",<br/>  confidence: 1.00,<br/>  reasoning: "User wants to create<br/>  automation plan for occupancy"<br/>}
        Note over Manager: 🎯 Routing to Plan Agent
    end

    Manager->>+Plan: Initialize & delegate<br/>{input, token}
    Note over Plan: 📋 Plan Agent loaded<br/>with LLM & MCP tools

    %% === STEP 1: ANALYZE INPUT ===
    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)
        Note over Plan,LLM: 🎯 STEP 1: ANALYZING USER INPUT
        
        Plan->>+LLM: Analyze with ANALYZE_INPUT_PROMPT<br/>"Have 1 person in the living room.<br/>Create plan."
        Note over LLM: Extract intent & requirements<br/>⏱️ ~10s
        LLM-->>-Plan: {<br/>  primary_intent: "create_plan",<br/>  context: {<br/>    room: "living room",<br/>    occupancy: 1,<br/>    action: "automation"<br/>  },<br/>  key_requirements: [<br/>    "comfort", "security", "energy"<br/>  ]<br/>}
        
        Note over Plan: ✅ Input analysis complete<br/>Primary Intent: create_plan
    end

    %% === STEP 2: GET DEVICES ===
    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
        Note over Plan,MCP: 🎯 STEP 2: RETRIEVING DEVICE INFORMATION
        
        Plan->>+MCP: Connect SSE & get tools
        MCP-->>-Plan: 7 MCP tools loaded
        
        Plan->>+MCP: call_tool("get_device_list",<br/>  {token})
        Note over MCP: Query OXII API<br/>⏱️ ~2s
        MCP-->>-Plan: Device data (1359 chars):<br/>[{<br/>  house_id: 1,<br/>  room_id: 101,<br/>  room_name: "Phòng khách",<br/>  buttons: [<br/>    {buttonId: 1001, name: "Quạt điện",<br/>     type: "FAN", status: "tắt"},<br/>    {buttonId: 1002, name: "Điều hòa",<br/>     type: "CONDITIONER", status: "tắt"}<br/>  ]<br/>}]
        
        Note over Plan: ✅ Device info retrieved<br/>🏠 Found 1 room with devices
    end

    %% === STEP 3: CREATE 3 PLANS ===
    rect rgb(255, 245, 220)
        Note over Plan,LLM: 🎯 STEP 3: CREATING 3 PRIORITY PLANS
        
        Plan->>+LLM: Generate plans with CREATE_PLANS_PROMPT<br/>Input:<br/>• User request<br/>• Input analysis<br/>• Device information<br/>Instruction: Create 3 plans<br/>(Security, Convenience, Energy)
        Note over LLM: Generate 3 priority plans<br/>with device-specific tasks<br/>⏱️ ~8s
        LLM-->>-Plan: Plans JSON:<br/>{<br/>  "Security_Plan": [<br/>    "Turn on Switch SH4 for security lighting",<br/>    "Turn off Quạt điện",<br/>    "Turn off Điều hòa"<br/>  ],<br/>  "Convenience_Plan": [<br/>    "Turn on Điều hòa at 24°C cool mode",<br/>    "Turn on Quạt điện",<br/>    "Turn on Switch SH4"<br/>  ],<br/>  "Energy_Plan": [<br/>    "Set Điều hòa to 26°C cool mode",<br/>    "Turn off Switch SH4",<br/>    "Turn off Quạt điện"<br/>  ]<br/>}
        
        Note over Plan: ✅ Plans created successfully:<br/>🔒 Security Plan: 3 tasks<br/>🏠 Convenience Plan: 3 tasks<br/>🌱 Energy Plan: 3 tasks
    end

    %% === FORMAT & RETURN ===
    Plan->>Plan: Format response with emoji<br/>and descriptions
    
    Note over Plan: Final Output:<br/>🏠 **Smart Home Automation Plans**<br/><br/>🔒 **Plan 1: Security Priority**<br/>   1. Turn on Switch SH4...<br/>   2. Turn off Quạt điện...<br/>   3. Turn off Điều hòa...<br/><br/>🏡 **Plan 2: Convenience Priority**<br/>   1. Turn on Điều hòa at 24°C...<br/>   ...<br/><br/>⚡ **Plan 3: Energy Efficiency**<br/>   ...
    
    Plan-->>-Manager: {<br/>  output: formatted_plans,<br/>  plan_options: {<br/>    "security_plan": [...],<br/>    "convenience_plan": [...],<br/>    "energy_plan": [...]<br/>  }<br/>}

    Manager->>Manager: finalize_response
    Manager->>Router: Store plan_options in Redis<br/>key: "testing1234_testing1234"
    
    Manager-->>-Router: Success response<br/>processing_time: 29.71s
    Note over Manager: ✅ Request processed<br/>💾 Plans cached for selection

    Router-->>-User: HTTP 200 OK<br/>Display 3 plans with selection prompt

    %% === TIMING BREAKDOWN ===
    Note over User,LLM: ⏱️ Timing Breakdown (Total: 29.71s)<br/><br/>• Manager routing: ~6s (LLM)<br/>• Plan Agent init: ~1s<br/>• Step 1 (Analyze input): ~10s (LLM)<br/>• Step 2 (Get devices): ~2s (MCP)<br/>• Step 3 (Create plans): ~8s (LLM)<br/>• Format & cache: ~2.5s<br/><br/>💡 Key Features:<br/>• 3-step workflow clearly separated<br/>• LLM used for intent analysis & plan generation<br/>• MCP used for device data retrieval<br/>• Plans cached in session for later execution
